{"1940090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Murder Is Game Over", "steam_appid": 1940090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2141420, 4874540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1785067426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras_big/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1785067426 width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Detective Guy and his trusty sidekick Cleo the clue-sniffing dog as they investigate the mysterious death of a fabulously wealthy game designer in rural Vermont. As you explore the castle grounds, search for clues, and interview suspects, can you solve the case and bring the guilty party to justice?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this exciting murder mystery game and test your sleuthing skills as you work to unravel the mystery and catch the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whodunit murder mystery gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a detective and dog crime-solving team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the castle grounds and search for clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview suspects and make deductions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the case and apprehend the guilty party</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/da908e6533ce82c20db290ddb77d3a64.avif?t=1785067426\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>How to access the DLC game:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1. Buy the DLC and install the game files.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2. Right click on &quot;Properties&quot; on the Murder Is Game Over icon in Steam.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3. Browse the Installed Files.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>4. Access the &quot;migodlc1&quot; directory. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5. Click on Game.exe and enjoy Final Fright!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1785067426\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras_big/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1785067426 width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Detective Guy and his trusty sidekick Cleo the clue-sniffing dog as they investigate the mysterious death of a fabulously wealthy game designer in rural Vermont. As you explore the castle grounds, search for clues, and interview suspects, can you solve the case and bring the guilty party to justice?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this exciting murder mystery game and test your sleuthing skills as you work to unravel the mystery and catch the killer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whodunit murder mystery gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a detective and dog crime-solving team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the castle grounds and search for clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview suspects and make deductions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the case and apprehend the guilty party</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/da908e6533ce82c20db290ddb77d3a64.avif?t=1785067426\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>How to access the DLC game:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1. Buy the DLC and install the game files.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2. Right click on &quot;Properties&quot; on the Murder Is Game Over icon in Steam.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3. Browse the Installed Files.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>4. Access the &quot;migodlc1&quot; directory. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5. Click on Game.exe and enjoy Final Fright!</i></p>", "short_description": "Join the investigation in Murder Is Game Over, a pixel art point-and-click game where you and Cleo try to solve the murder of a famous game designer. Can you uncover the clues and catch the killer before it's game over?", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“A game that cosily leads you through the mystery as opposed to getting your grey cells pulsating, Murder is Game Over is a fun and light-hearted way to spend an evening.”<br>7.5/10 – Games Freezer<br><br>“I am delighted to suggest this game to aficionados of the genre because it is extremely cheaply priced for the experience it provides.”<br>8/10 – Hardcore Gamers Unified<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/header.jpg?t=1785067426", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785067426", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785067426", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, 7, 8, or 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/AMD Quad-Core 2+ Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>G